    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30860" root="عهد" body-key="E">
    
      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعاهدوا</span></b>  <i>They united in a compact, a contract, a covenant, an agreement, a confederacy,
a league, a treaty,</i> or <i>an engagement,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَى كَذَا</span>
<i>respecting,</i> or <i>to do, such a thing;</i>] syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَاقَدُوا</span>,
(S and K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عقد</span>,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَالَفُوا</span>. (S and K in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حلف</span>.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also 5, in six places.

